    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "In Dice Up, eating food gives you powers. Eating a large block of food gives you a powerful effect but can only be used once. Dicing up your food into smaller piece allows you to use you power multiple times but at a reduce strength. Determine how to dice up each food to gain the right quantity and strength of powers to reach the exit.<br><br><br>Dice up your food into either big, medium or small pieces. Dicing into smaller pieces will give you more pieces to use but with a weaker effect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Eat food to gain powers allowing you to better traverse the levels.<br><br>For example:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eating an onion makes you cry. You can run on your tears to move faster. Running on the tears from a small chunk of onion will give you a small speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a medium sized piece of onion will lead to a greater speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a whole onion will give the maximum speed boost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Each world introduces a new mechanic into the levels leading to more complex puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Use Your Resources Wisely to Reach the Exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "In Dice Up, eating food gives you powers. Eating a large block of food gives you a powerful effect but can only be used once. Dicing up your food into smaller piece allows you to use you power multiple times but at a reduce strength. Determine how to dice up each food to gain the right quantity and strength of powers to reach the exit.<br><br><br>Dice up your food into either big, medium or small pieces. Dicing into smaller pieces will give you more pieces to use but with a weaker effect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dae811cdd9bc53e762de73cb343bcee7.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Eat food to gain powers allowing you to better traverse the levels.<br><br>For example:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eating an onion makes you cry. You can run on your tears to move faster. Running on the tears from a small chunk of onion will give you a small speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a medium sized piece of onion will lead to a greater speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a whole onion will give the maximum speed boost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/03ace00c74f452d3fac8b80b934ea1d5.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Each world introduces a new mechanic into the levels leading to more complex puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/895ffbf7b3a0413d54481ed37ebff141.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Use Your Resources Wisely to Reach the Exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.poster.avif?t=1721041230\" width=590 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.webm?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/118dd3da858723c5e0e03c61f82ab668.mp4?t=1721041230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
